{"h":3406,"w":2400,"lines":[{"w":0.06391752243041994,"h":0.014679976512037562,"x":0.065979383015276047,"y":0.053728713773685155,"c":1,"t":"Test 2"},{"w":0.18762886047363281,"c":1,"t":"Questions 21-24","x":0.065979383556998047,"y":0.10174418605592916,"h":0.015989225749331148},{"x":0.063774327690287916,"t":"Complete the summary below.","w":0.30753651936848958,"y":0.13945504562017641,"h":0.018952208970899331,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Choose ONE WORD ONLY from the passage for each answer.","x":0.065979378964321808,"w":0.63917526245117184,"h":0.015988371754420694,"y":0.1773255815616448},{"y":0.21366279041870284,"w":0.58762888590494788,"h":0.017441861012089777,"c":1,"x":0.065979371303507339,"t":"Write your answers in boxes 21-24 on your answer sheet."},{"w":0.33195877075195318,"x":0.34432989289812893,"y":0.25425719304799921,"h":0.017615971814445075,"t":"Jared Diamond's View","c":1},{"w":0.88865976969401039,"h":0.015988371754420694,"c":1,"y":0.29505813970225869,"t":"Diamond believes that the Polynesian settlers on Rapa Nui destroyed its forests, cutting","x":0.063917537726836518},{"x":0.061779938793414528,"y":0.31240020554925085,"w":0.48259460449218744,"t":"down its trees for fuel and clearing land for 21 ...","h":0.018674993823012742,"c":1},{"y":0.31222110173692363,"c":1,"x":0.59785526936020961,"t":"...... Twentieth-century discoveres","w":0.34455421447753898,"h":0.01990069099824987},{"c":1,"t":"of pollen prove that Rapu Nui had once been covered in palm forests, which had turned","x":0.063917537747924483,"y":0.33139534856061903,"h":0.017441861012089777,"w":0.88865976969401039},{"y":0.34879624191025593,"t":"into grassland by the time the Europeans arrived on the island. When the islanders were","x":0.059793792269737196,"w":0.89896911621093745,"h":0.017615971814445075,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"no longer able to build the 22 ..","w":0.30950594584147134,"y":0.36749717554524919,"h":0.018111697660077697,"x":0.063778503309625409},{"h":0.021302049046604377,"x":0.44114251595639303,"w":0.50125076293945314,"y":0.3665681245530561,"c":1,"t":"... they needed to go fishing, they began using the"},{"t":"island's 23","h":0.014743721492137873,"c":1,"y":0.38652348774560208,"x":0.061828383238842877,"w":0.11139478047688803},{"w":0.68865976969401044,"h":0.017441861012089666,"t":".. as a food source, according to Diamond. Diamond also claims that","c":1,"x":0.25979382634344517,"y":0.38662790669866753},{"t":"the moai were built to show the power of the island's chieftains, and that the methods of","x":0.061855668437185707,"w":0.89278350830078113,"y":0.40546095142955463,"h":0.017615971814445075,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.017448688491400244,"y":0.42441860437545698,"w":0.89690724690755219,"x":0.061855654803614754,"t":"transporting the statues needed not only a great number of people, but also a great deal"},{"w":0.053608245849609375,"h":0.013081395479068947,"y":0.44331395338883151,"t":"of 24","c":1,"x":0.061855670824517074},{"t":"Questions 25 and 26","h":0.015988371754420583,"y":0.478197674580504,"x":0.065979387633444866,"w":0.22886596679687504,"c":1},{"t":"Choose TWO letters, A-E.","h":0.017615971814445075,"x":0.063917528682720687,"y":0.51585437469124962,"w":0.27216494242350264,"c":1},{"t":"Write the correct letters in boxes 25 and 26 on your answer sheet.","w":0.66631261189778646,"h":0.021421910732267069,"c":1,"x":0.063769899428609833,"y":0.5495761968816385},{"y":0.58788871599160408,"h":0.018989923626131944,"c":1,"x":0.063805421282549873,"t":"On what points do Hunt and Lipo disagree with Diamond?","w":0.58370697021484375},{"x":0.15867531247539896,"w":0.3981412506103516,"t":"the period when the moai were created","y":0.61628826750509635,"h":0.017668618220689325,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.016147974163241319,"x":0.15876289213168321,"w":0.3175257619222005,"t":"how the moai were transported","y":0.63652378136134247},{"c":1,"h":0.01453488361674482,"x":0.11134020638561812,"t":"C","y":0.65552325574492221,"w":0.016494844754536941},{"x":0.11134020640034566,"w":0.016494844754536955,"h":0.013081